Error [jet.ImplOnBuiltinType]: `impl Shape` needs a user-defined type
  --> tests/ui/impl_trait_outside_type_body_is_e0301.jet:5:6
    |
  5 | impl Shape {
    |      ^^^^^
 Why: `Shape` is a trait, and an `impl` outside a type body only extends a declared struct, enum, or distinct type, so these methods would belong to no type
 Fix: Write `impl Type.Shape { … }` for the type that implements `Shape`, or move the block into that type's body
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0301
